  <graph edgedefault="undirected">
    <node id="&quot;VICKIE SAWYER&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"PERSON"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Vickie Sawyer is a prominent figure in North Carolina politics, serving as a Member of the North Carolina Senate and recently becoming the first foreign-born municipal councilor in Saint-Yvoine, France."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0283</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;NORTH CAROLINA SENATE&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"ORGANIZATION"</data>
      <data key="d1">"North Carolina Senate is a legislative body in North Carolina, where Vickie Sawyer serves as a senator."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0283</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;NORTH CAROLINA GENERAL ASSEMBLY&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"ORGANIZATION"</data>
      <data key="d1">"North Carolina General Assembly is the state legislature of North Carolina, where Vickie Sawyer is a member."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0283</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;DISTRICT 34&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"LOCATION"</data>
      <data key="d1">"District 34 is the area represented by Vickie Sawyer in the North Carolina Senate."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0283</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;SENATOR PHIL BERGER&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"PERSON"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Phil Berger is the President Pro Tempore of the North Carolina Senate and has praised Vickie Sawyer's contributions."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0283</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;SENATOR RALPH HISE&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"PERSON"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Ralph Hise is the Chairman of the Senate Committee on Education and has highlighted Vickie Sawyer's work on education."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0283</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;SAINT-YVOINE&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"LOCATION"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Saint-Yvoine is a small town in the Puy-de-Dôme region of France where Vickie Sawyer has been appointed as a municipal councilor."&lt;SEP&gt;"Saint-Yvoine is a town where the election of a new councilor is taking place, and it is described as a beautiful town where the new councilor aims to make a positive impact."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0283</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;PUY-DE-DÔME&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"LOCATION"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Puy-de-Dôme is a department in the Auvergne-Rhône-Alpes region of France, containing the town of Saint-Yvoine."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0283</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;FRENCH MINISTRY OF THE INTERIOR&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"ORGANIZATION"</data>
      <data key="d1">"French Ministry of the Interior is the governmental body that oversees local elections and has confirmed Vickie Sawyer's appointment."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0283</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;MAYOR PIERRE DUPONT&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"PERSON"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Pierre Dupont is the mayor of Saint-Yvoine and has expressed support for Vickie Sawyer's appointment."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0283</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;DR. SOPHIE LAURENT&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"PERSON"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Sophie Laurent is a political scientist at the University of Clermont-Ferrand and has commented on the significance of Vickie Sawyer's appointment."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0283</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;RALEIGH, NC&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"LOCATION"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Raleigh, NC is the capital city of North Carolina where Vickie Sawyer's official recognition as a Member of the North Carolina Senate was announced."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0283</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;2019 ELECTION&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"EVENT"</data>
      <data key="d1">"The 2019 Election is the event during which Vickie Sawyer was elected to the North Carolina Senate, securing over 60% of the vote in her district."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0283</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;COMMITTEE ON EDUCATION&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"ORGANIZATION"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Committee on Education is a subcommittee of the North Carolina Senate where Vickie Sawyer has worked on education-related issues."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0283</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;HEALTH CARE COMMITTEE&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"ORGANIZATION"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Health Care Committee is another subcommittee of the North Carolina Senate where Vickie Sawyer has worked on health care-related issues."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0283</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;TRANSPORTATION COMMITTEE&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"ORGANIZATION"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Transportation Committee is a subcommittee of the North Carolina Senate where Vickie Sawyer has worked on transportation-related issues."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0283</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;NORTH CAROLINIANS&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"PERSON_GROUP"</data>
      <data key="d1">"North Carolinians are the constituents Vickie Sawyer serves and represents in the North Carolina Senate."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0283</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;AMERICAN POLITICS&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"CONCEPT"</data>
      <data key="d1">"American Politics is the broader context in which Vickie Sawyer has gained experience before her appointment in Saint-Yvoine, France."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0283</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;INTERNATIONALIZATION&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"CONCEPT"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Internationalization is the trend of increasing foreign involvement in local politics, exemplified by Vickie Sawyer's appointment in Saint-Yvoine, France."&lt;SEP&gt;"Internationalization refers to the growing trend of foreign-born individuals taking on leadership roles in local politics."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0283</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;LOCAL GOVERNANCE&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"CONCEPT"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Local Governance is the area of responsibility for the municipal councilors in Saint-Yvoine, France, where Vickie Sawyer serves."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0283</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;ENVIRONMENTAL SUSTAINABILITY&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"CONCEPT"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Environmental Sustainability is one of the key issues discussed in the first council meeting of Vickie Sawyer in Saint-Yvoine, France."&lt;SEP&gt;"Environmental sustainability is one of the pressing issues to be discussed at the upcoming council meeting."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0283</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;INFRASTRUCTURE DEVELOPMENT&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"CONCEPT"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Infrastructure Development is another key issue discussed in the first council meeting of Vickie Sawyer in Saint-Yvoine, France."&lt;SEP&gt;"Infrastructure development is one of the pressing issues to be discussed at the upcoming council meeting."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0283</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;SAWYER&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"PERSON"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Sawyer is a person who has recently won an election and is set to take on a new role as a councilor in Saint-Yvoine, demonstrating a commitment to listening to the community and addressing their concerns."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0283</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;COUNCIL MEETING&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"EVENT"</data>
      <data key="d1">"A Council Meeting is an upcoming event where Sawyer will join her fellow councilors to discuss important issues such as infrastructure development and environmental sustainability."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0283</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;PRESSING ISSUES&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"CONCEPT"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Pressing issues include infrastructure development and environmental sustainability, which are topics to be discussed at the upcoming council meeting."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0283</data>
    </node>
